        "Aathmanu Rakshinche - Vaakyam Prakatinchaali",
        "Baibil Baagaa Nerchukuni - Lokaaniki Vellaali",
        "Dehaanni Devuni Sevaku - Sajeevangaa Ivvaali",
        "Aaraadhanaa Aaraadhana - Aathmanu Rakshinchutaye Aaraadhana",
